     "text": [
      "Hi . I'm a machine that listens . What's been on your mind lately ?\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdin",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      ">  i miss my grandpa\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "What do you miss most about your grandpa ?\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdin",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      ">  i dont know , i just haven't seen him for a long time\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "You don't know . That's okay . What do you feel instead ?\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdin",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      ">  I feel sad and I wish I get to spend more time with him\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "What would change for you if you get to spend more time with him ?\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdin",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      ">  i can see him get old\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Tell me more about that .\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdin",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      ">  he is old and i think he is dying\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "How does that sit with you ?\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdin",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      ">  i dont want to say goodbye to him\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "That's alright . Not everything needs an answer today .\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdin",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      ">  bye\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Thank you for talking with me . Be gentle with yourself today .\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "import eliza\n",
    "\n",
    "bot = eliza.Eliza()\n",
    "bot.load('hope.txt')\n",
    "\n",
    "print(bot.initial())\n",
    "while True:\n",
    "    said = input('> ')\n",
    "    response = bot.respond(said)\n",
    "    if response is None:\n",
    "        break\n",
    "    print(response)\n",
    "print(bot.final())"
   ]
  },
